OL,3,AReform boycotts Senedd after member
OL,4,Abanned for saying white people are
OL,5,Abeing replaced
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform UK will partially boycott the
OL,8,FSenedd to protest the ban of one of
OL,9,Ftheir politicians for claiming white
OL,10,Fpeople are being "replaced".
OL,12,FThe party's Welsh leader, Helen Jenner,
OL,13,Fsaid Joe Martin's ban was because of
OL,14,F"undue pressure" from governing party
OL,15,FPlaid Cymru and was an "infringement on
OL,16,Ffreedom of speech".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
